'''Type of Feat''': [[General]]

'''Prerequisites''': [[Dexterity]] 17, [[Base Attack Bonus]] 6, [[Point Blank Shot]], [[Rapid Shot]]

'''Specifics''': You can fire multiple arrows simultaneously against a nearby target (30 feet). You may fire 2 arrows with a -4 penalty. For every 5 points in [[Base Attack Bonus]] you have above +6, you may add an arrow with a cumulative -2 to a maximum of 4 arrows with a cumulative of -8.

'''Use:''': Selected

